      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "There was merit in the latest performance of TEX GOES BANG (4) when he came from a couple of spots wider for fourth at this venue. Should enjoy the favours from this draw so has winning claims. SENNA STORM (2) had a tough draw when resuming so is much better served by this barrier. Fitter so looking for improvement. MIKI MARK (10) continues to race well and added to a string of placings when he raced parked but boxed on for a 2m second here last start. Draws on the back row but with even luck he could break through. OPERTSER (5) placed two back at Cranbourne then worked to the front from this barrier and stuck on when 6m off the winner last week. Can give a sight again. DOT BALL (7) draws wide but put the writing on the wall when beaten narrowly into second here last time out.",
